#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>Rank B<case>Rank A<case>Rank S</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n3><case>Activating in: <num $n4>:<num2 $n5><case>Unclaimed<case>Claimed <icon 51><case>Claimed <icon 52><case>Claimed <icon 53></switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 3 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n4> — a number; value = number parameter 4 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
